          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "附件《哀地里亞食譜之把死的做成活的》已傳送",
          "next": [
            201970004
          ]
        },
        "201970004": {
          "id": 201970004,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "附件《買不到的雅努斯味蕾》已傳送",
          "next": [
            201970005
          ]
        },
        "201970005": {
          "id": 201970005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "想挑戰一下自己",
          "next": [
            201970006
          ]
        },
        "201970006": {
          "id": 201970006,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "吃嗎？",
          "next": [
            201970007,
            201970008,
            201970010
          ]
        },
        "201970007": {
          "id": 201970007,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "當然啊大廚，我什麼都吃",
          "next": [
            201970012
          ]
        },
        "201970008": {
          "id": 201970008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "大廚，能把你傳的所有菜品都吃了嗎",
          "next": [
            201970009
          ]
        },
        "201970009": {
          "id": 201970009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "你吃得下的話，都可以",
          "next": [
            201970012
          ]
        },
        "201970010": {
          "id": 201970010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "有請萬大廚炒！",
          "next": [
            201970011
          ]
        },
        "201970011": {
          "id": 201970011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "可以",
          "next": [
            201970012
          ]
        },
        "201970012": {
          "id": 201970012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "那就從《懸鋒的深夜食堂》開始吧",
          "next": [
            201970013
          ]
        },
        "201970013": {
          "id": 201970013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "雖然上面的食譜與風格我都有試過，但懸鋒菜肯定是最拿手的",
          "next": [
            201970014,
            201970015,
            201970016
          ]
        },
        "201970014": {
          "id": 201970014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "生拌鹿心？",
          "next": [
            201970017
          ]
        },
        "201970015": {
          "id": 201970015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "碳烤蜥蜴腿？",
          "next": [
            201970017
          ]
        },
        "201970016": {
          "id": 201970016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "很重口味嗎？",
          "next": [
            201970017
          ]
        },
        "201970017": {
          "id": 201970017,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "看來你對我們誤解很深",
          "next": [
            201970018
          ]
        },
        "201970018": {
          "id": 201970018,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "那些只是過去懸鋒人用來測試勇士的陋習，我早已將其廢止",
          "next": [
            201970019
          ]
        },
        "201970019": {
          "id": 201970019,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "現在的懸鋒菜，都是營養全面、健康豐富的食物",
          "next": [
            201970020
          ]
        },
        "201970020": {
          "id": 201970020,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "也融合其他菜系的優點改良",
          "next": [
            201970021
          ]
        },
        "201970021": {
          "id": 201970021,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "你偏愛什麼樣的口味嗎？",
          "next": [
            201970022,
            201970024,
            201970026
          ]
        },
        "201970022": {
          "id": 201970022,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "喜歡吃重口味的",
          "next": [
            201970023
          ]
        },
        "201970023": {
          "id": 201970023,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "那麼就醬燜雲羊肋排吧，這道菜能很好地補充鹽分，促進食慾。最好配點石榴汁。",
          "next": [
            201970031
          ]
        },
        "201970024": {
          "id": 201970024,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "想要正常的食物",
          "next": [
            201970025
          ]
        },
        "201970025": {
          "id": 201970025,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "酸豆泥配合石榴蜜餅，什麼時候都不會錯",
          "next": [
            201970031
          ]
        },
        "201970026": {
          "id": 201970026,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "不是怪味的我不吃",
          "next": [
            201970027
          ]
        },
        "201970027": {
          "id": 201970027,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "冥海魚罐頭或許符合你的選擇",
          "next": [
            201970028
          ]
        },
        "201970028": {
          "id": 201970028,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "我很少用它來做菜",
          "next": [
            201970029
          ]
        },
        "201970029": {
          "id": 201970029,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "或者我可以去取存放十年以上的獸肉",
          "next": [
            201970030
          ]
        },
        "201970030": {
          "id": 201970030,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "那味道絕對令你難忘",
          "next": [
            201970031
          ]
        },
        "201970031": {
          "id": 201970031,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "next": [
            201970032
          ]
        },
        "201970032": {
          "id": 201970032,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "懸鋒城有句諺語傳播甚廣：「想當將軍的戰士，必須先是個出色的主廚」",
          "next": [
            201970033
          ]
        },
        "201970033": {
          "id": 201970033,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "所以，相信我的烹飪與搭配能力",
          "next": [
            201970034
          ]
        },
        "201970034": {
          "id": 201970034,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1404,
          "text": "預祝你好胃口",
          "next": []
        }
      },
      "participatingContactsIds": [
        8001,
        1404
      ]
    }
  ]
}